ic activity in this area  not that we know of merrick  why  i think i just felt something move down  here  come in command  elevator's stuck  we went down maybe about a foot before  we hit something no idea  what's that sound  [Applause]  [Music]  come in merrick what is your status  [Applause]  we managed to open the doors and climb  out we've got an unknown amorphous mass  coming up from the lower levels  recommend immediate counter measures  copy that merrick we have two f-4s on  standby  they'll be with you in approximately  seven minutes can you hold out i have no  [ __ ] clue come on right now we're  trying every trick in the book but every  time we damage it it seems to grow more  rapidly ashton see what a couple lemons  do to that thing  command i hope those words you said and  have something up more that'll stick  because nothing more carrion seems to be  stopping this thing don't worry the guys  in ia said they know how to deal with  this get your team out of there merrick  got me  there status merrick we're okay but this  thing just exploded through the top soil  and it's still growing  those birds better get here fast eta  approximately six minutes how fast is it  moving  get out of there merrick what's going on  we lost jones he just got sucked under  that thing i have no idea what his speed  is and i don't care get those birds here  now  at 1422 utc gmt two f4 phantoms dropped  their payload of m47a1  napalm incendiary bombs successfully  cauterizing the tissue generated by  scp-2102  during its uer 2102 event in progress  addendum 2102 a3  translated excerpts from captured gru  division p documentation  the following selected diary entries  were found amongst paperwork recovered  from the institute of experimental  medicine csav their author could not  definitively be determined  date 2nd of march  1972.  finally arrived i swear the tupolev was  shaking more than the bmp i rode in  during my service the equipment crates  were already there and mostly 